Fri Nov  6 17:10:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of FVWM-Crystal 3.7.6+git20260923.0ac6f21
  * Ship a restricted sudoers file (power management commands only)
    instead of the one generated by upstream's makesudoers.sh
  * Create the fvwm-crystal group via sysusers
  * Do not install the Gentoo-specific /etc/X11/Sessions script
  * Use absolute script interpreters instead of /usr/bin/env
  * Add fvwm-crystal-trailblazer-quote.patch: fix a shell syntax
    error in the Trailblazer menu launcher
